Songsong Liu. Supply chain management for the process industry, doctoral thesis, Department of Chemical Engineering, University College London, 2011. [Institutional thesis record](https://discovery.ucl.ac.uk/id/eprint/1331895/) · [Full thesis](https://discovery.ucl.ac.uk/1331895/1/1331895.pdf).

Read the whole thesis for the advanced process-supply study, deriving the actual planning/scheduling and uncertainty formulations, reconstructing its published cases, and following the methods' primary literature. Compare alternative objectives and the physical assumptions behind each demand, storage and production constraint.

